        "eyebrow": "Case study 02 · cg-cms, my product",
        "title": "MY LARAVEL CMS.\n*Pages in 0.4 ms.*",
        "title_size": "large",
        "heading_level": "1",
        "lede": "The CMS this site runs on: an Inertia and React admin, content in Postgres, and every page written to disk when it's saved."
      }
    },
    {
